{"3814650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Curyeux", "steam_appid": 3814650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Curyeux</strong> is a dreamlike <strong>puzzle-platformer</strong> where <strong>Lucienne Grégoire</strong>, the protagonist, embarks on a <strong>personal quest</strong> for meaning. Journey through fragmented memories drawn from her artistic world, as she dives deep into a period of intense introspection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/7746d5b4d2977b66777d7f305166b073.avif?t=1766011596\" width=780 height=823 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a piece of memory, where logic gives way to perception. You’ll need to run, jump, solve, circumvent, and understand in order to move forward… and uncover yourself along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/142ebca351264dcfa493be1f8559bf6c.poster.avif?t=1766011596\" width=780 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/142ebca351264dcfa493be1f8559bf6c.webm?t=1766011596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/142ebca351264dcfa493be1f8559bf6c.mp4?t=1766011596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure leads you through ever-changing painterly <strong>environments</strong> : sketches, watercolors, bursts of color and brushstrokes, where appearances are often <strong>deceiving</strong>. Lucienne must learn to see through her own illusions, accept who she is, and break <strong>free</strong> from the gaze of others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/dcc98b8ebac0285990cfaa840647a9f0.poster.avif?t=1766011596\" width=778 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/dcc98b8ebac0285990cfaa840647a9f0.webm?t=1766011596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/dcc98b8ebac0285990cfaa840647a9f0.mp4?t=1766011596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 A variety of <strong>painterly landscapes</strong>, where every shape reflects an emotional state.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 <strong>Puzzles</strong> that <strong>challenge</strong> your reasoning and perception : observe, understand, and experiment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌌 A <strong>symbolic</strong> and <strong>touching narrative</strong>, told through the environment, movement, sound, and gameplay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/bf9be2daf1b2b05a2c52b49479365f10.poster.avif?t=1766011596\" width=778 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/bf9be2daf1b2b05a2c52b49479365f10.webm?t=1766011596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/bf9be2daf1b2b05a2c52b49479365f10.mp4?t=1766011596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <strong>introspective</strong> journey about <strong>identity</strong>, self-acceptance, and the transformative power of <strong>doubt</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Curyeux</strong> is a dreamlike <strong>puzzle-platformer</strong> where <strong>Lucienne Grégoire</strong>, the protagonist, embarks on a <strong>personal quest</strong> for meaning. Journey through fragmented memories drawn from her artistic world, as she dives deep into a period of intense introspection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/7746d5b4d2977b66777d7f305166b073.avif?t=1766011596\" width=780 height=823 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a piece of memory, where logic gives way to perception. You’ll need to run, jump, solve, circumvent, and understand in order to move forward… and uncover yourself along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/142ebca351264dcfa493be1f8559bf6c.poster.avif?t=1766011596\" width=780 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/142ebca351264dcfa493be1f8559bf6c.webm?t=1766011596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/142ebca351264dcfa493be1f8559bf6c.mp4?t=1766011596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure leads you through ever-changing painterly <strong>environments</strong> : sketches, watercolors, bursts of color and brushstrokes, where appearances are often <strong>deceiving</strong>. Lucienne must learn to see through her own illusions, accept who she is, and break <strong>free</strong> from the gaze of others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/dcc98b8ebac0285990cfaa840647a9f0.poster.avif?t=1766011596\" width=778 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/dcc98b8ebac0285990cfaa840647a9f0.webm?t=1766011596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/dcc98b8ebac0285990cfaa840647a9f0.mp4?t=1766011596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 A variety of <strong>painterly landscapes</strong>, where every shape reflects an emotional state.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 <strong>Puzzles</strong> that <strong>challenge</strong> your reasoning and perception : observe, understand, and experiment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌌 A <strong>symbolic</strong> and <strong>touching narrative</strong>, told through the environment, movement, sound, and gameplay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/bf9be2daf1b2b05a2c52b49479365f10.poster.avif?t=1766011596\" width=778 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/bf9be2daf1b2b05a2c52b49479365f10.webm?t=1766011596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/extras/bf9be2daf1b2b05a2c52b49479365f10.mp4?t=1766011596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <strong>introspective</strong> journey about <strong>identity</strong>, self-acceptance, and the transformative power of <strong>doubt</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Dive into the mind of Lucienne, a tormented painter. Leap through emotional memories, solve puzzles where shapes deceive and emotion leads the way. A dreamlike platformer where each painting brings you one step closer to yourself.", "supported_languages": "French<strong>*</strong>, English, Italian, German, Russian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Ukrainian, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“This visual jewel is a rare gem”<br>JV<br><br>“Proof that you can create something exceptionnal even in an academic setting.”<br>Next Stage<br><br>“A rare example of what  a new generation of developpers can make, when they are free to create without commercial concerns.”<br>La crème du gaming<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/50f35e088c23a00cd183c0d960870b2e56ccc685/header.jpg?t=1766011596", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/625f97c2aa5214cbf96302363ad0f12d2cf153fe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766011596", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814650/625f97c2aa5214cbf96302363ad0f12d2cf153fe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766011596", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-8750H CPU @ 2.20GHz (12 CPUs)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32768 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1070<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-12900 (24 CPUs), ~2.4GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 65536 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</